<section class="ps-native-banner"><div class="ps-native-kicker">PISHIELD / HOST PROTECTION</div><h2>Host security</h2><p>Local security checks and DNS warning signs. This Pi is not the network gateway.</p></section>
<div class="box box-primary"><div class="box-header with-border"><h3 class="box-title">Protection status</h3></div><div class="box-body"><p id="ps110-status" role="status">Loading…</p><div id="ps110-summary" class="ps1-status"></div><p>Firewall setup requires local administrator approval and a timed connectivity test. See the installation guide.</p><button id="ps110-refresh" type="button" class="btn btn-default">Refresh status</button></div></div>
<div class="box box-primary"><div class="box-header with-border"><h3 class="box-title">DNS warning signs</h3></div><div class="box-body"><p>High volume, failed lookups and long names are clues, not evidence of an attack. A forwarding router can hide individual clients.</p><div id="ps110-dns"></div></div></div>
<div class="box box-primary"><div class="box-header with-border"><h3 class="box-title">File integrity</h3></div><div class="box-body"><p>Changes compared with the saved installation baseline. Review changes before accepting a new baseline.</p><div id="ps110-integrity"></div></div></div>
<div class="box box-primary"><div class="box-header with-border"><h3 class="box-title">Listening services</h3></div><div class="box-body"><p>Local sockets only; a listening address does not prove external reachability.</p><div id="ps110-listeners"></div></div></div>
